        "original_id": "c959e7b9-fa06-5834-993e-7423f5750c81",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Toro Rosso STR12\n- Organizations: Scuderia Toro Rosso, Formula One, GP2 Series, Formula Renault 3.5 Series\n- People: Daniil Kvyat, Carlos Sainz Jr., Pierre Gasly\n- Events: 2017 Formula One season, 2017 Australian Grand Prix, 2017 Malaysian Grand Prix\n\nFacts:\n- The Toro Rosso STR12 is a Formula One racing car designed and constructed by Scuderia Toro Rosso for the 2017 Formula One season.\n- Pierre Gasly was born on 7 February 1996 in Rouen and is a French formula racing driver.\n- Pierre Gasly was the runner-up in the 2014 Formula Renault 3.5 Series.\n- Pierre Gasly won the 2016 GP2 Series championship.\n- The Toro Rosso STR12 made its competitive debut at the 2017 Australian Grand Prix.\n- Daniil Kvyat and Carlos Sainz Jr. drove the Toro Rosso STR12 at the start of the 2017 Formula One season.\n- Pierre Gasly replaced Daniil Kvyat in the Toro Rosso STR12 ahead of the 2017 Malaysian Grand Prix.",
